A collection of scripts to sync my school's tasks
(from #link("https://www.instructure.com/canvas")[Canvas] and
#link("https://www.gradescope.com/")[Gradescope]) to my personal
#link("https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CalDAV")[CalDAV] server. I didn't want to look at
three websites (Canvas, Gradescope, and my TODO app) in order to figure out what
to do, and instead just look at my TODO apps.

#link("https://github.com/nyiyui/caldav-canvas-gradescope")[Source code]

This project was partially vibecoded (specifically `canvas.py` and `caldav_sync.py`).
